#   (8000/7999 ... 48000/47996), clock registers identical at every rate, ADC alive
#   at every rate; 3/3 route transitions; restore measured at 16000 Hz.
#   8 kHz WORKS -- Espressif's undocumented 512 kHz BCLK floor is not a real constraint.
